==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|leigu||of or pertaining to renting}} the genitive of {{m|is|leiga||rent}} and {{m|is|bíll||a car}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈleiːɣʏˌpitl/|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|leigubíls|leigubílar}}

# a [[taxi]], a [[taxicab]], a [[cab]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-m-s1|leigub|í|l|l}}

